[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2751673620","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/104490#issuecomment-2751673620","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/104490","id":2751673620,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6kAzUU","user":{"login":"akien-mga","id":4701338,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3MDEzMzg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4701338?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga","html_url":"https://github.com/akien-mga","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-03-25T15:32:58Z","updated_at":"2025-03-25T15:32:58Z","body":"I think this is a good compromise. My only remaining nitpick is the cut `<empty>` which becomes just `<e  ` when there's the icon and the filesystem dock is narrow. I don't know if that's an extreme example or if that's a situation that would happen frequently, but if the latter, I think that's something we might want to improve somewhat, it doesn't look very polished.","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2751673620/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2751724433","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/104490#issuecomment-2751724433","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/104490","id":2751724433,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6kA_uR","user":{"login":"KoBeWi","id":2223172,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIyMjMxNzI=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2223172?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi","html_url":"https://github.com/KoBeWi","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-03-25T15:48:18Z","updated_at":"2025-03-25T15:48:18Z","body":"`<empty>` is not cut with default inspector size.\r\nAlthough without the button, it's not cut even with minimal inspector size, so that's one thing made worse. Maybe we can enforce the minimum size somehow (though it would make minimum inspector size bigger).","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2751724433/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2751761707","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/104490#issuecomment-2751761707","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/104490","id":2751761707,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6kBI0r","user":{"login":"arkology","id":43543909,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQzNTQzOTA5","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/43543909?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/arkology","html_url":"https://github.com/arkology","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arkology/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arkology/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arkology/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arkology/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arkology/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arkology/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arkology/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arkology/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arkology/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-03-25T16:00:38Z","updated_at":"2025-03-25T17:05:26Z","body":"Thank you very much for feedback!\r\n\r\nI would prefer not to increase dock minimum size.\r\nBecause there is complex problem with editor (and its panels/docks) minimum size (I downloaded Unity to see how it handles this situation and looks like they don't have such problem), so increasing minimum size of one dock may break other docks. At the moment, I am coming to the conclusion that all panels should have minimum size as small as reasonable possible. Several text symbols cutout at minimum window size should be fine, as they don't include unique and important information and it is possible just to resize window.\r\nSo with default size dock should properly show all its content, for \"minified\" dock it is not necessary.\r\n\r\nAs alternative solution - maybe replace `<empty>` with something else when only 3 (for example) or less characters are shown.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2751761707/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2752248479","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/104490#issuecomment-2752248479","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/104490","id":2752248479,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6kC_qf","user":{"login":"firebelley","id":4622925,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ2MjI5MjU=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4622925?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/firebelley","html_url":"https://github.com/firebelley","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/firebelley/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/firebelley/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/firebelley/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/firebelley/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/firebelley/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/firebelley/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/firebelley/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/firebelley/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/firebelley/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-03-25T18:59:23Z","updated_at":"2025-03-25T19:02:57Z","body":"I am not a _huge_ fan of the button, but showing it only on empty resources is good. I would much prefer a hidden way of opening quick load, like Ctrl+Click for quick load (or some other modifier key + click).\r\n\r\nThe inspector generally feels very cluttered and cramped to me, and this extra button seems to exacerbate that problem.","author_association":"NONE","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2752248479/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2752272512","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/104490#issuecomment-2752272512","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/104490","id":2752272512,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6kDFiA","user":{"login":"arkology","id":43543909,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQzNTQzOTA5","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/43543909?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/arkology","html_url":"https://github.com/arkology","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arkology/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arkology/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arkology/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arkology/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arkology/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arkology/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arkology/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arkology/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arkology/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-03-25T19:09:21Z","updated_at":"2025-03-26T08:09:24Z","body":"@firebelley thanks for feedback!\r\n\r\n> a hidden way of opening quick load, like Ctrl+Click\r\n\r\nAs someone who is typing this comment from android tablet, I could verify that there is no Ctrl button :) I mean, don't forget about android users. Also hidden way will hit discoverability significantly.\r\n\r\nActually, I can try to add editor setting for visibility of this button (will be visible by default), but I think it is too much.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2752272512/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2762344596","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/104490#issuecomment-2762344596","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/104490","id":2762344596,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6kpgiU","user":{"login":"arkology","id":43543909,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQzNTQzOTA5","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/43543909?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/arkology","html_url":"https://github.com/arkology","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arkology/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arkology/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arkology/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arkology/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arkology/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arkology/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arkology/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arkology/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arkology/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-03-28T20:08:33Z","updated_at":"2025-03-28T20:08:33Z","body":"Would be lovely to get feedback from @passivestar 🙂","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2762344596/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2762715250","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/104490#issuecomment-2762715250","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/104490","id":2762715250,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6kq7By","user":{"login":"passivestar","id":60579014,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYwNTc5MDE0","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/60579014?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/passivestar","html_url":"https://github.com/passivestar","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/passivestar/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/passivestar/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/passivestar/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/passivestar/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/passivestar/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/passivestar/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/passivestar/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/passivestar/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/passivestar/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-03-28T22:22:20Z","updated_at":"2025-03-28T22:22:20Z","body":"Quick Load button shown when the field is empty makes sense to me\r\n\r\nI'm not a big fan that there are 2 buttons in the same row that open the same dropdown menu. It was awkward before, but now that there's a Quick Load button separating them it looks even more awkward :)\r\n\r\nThis is however a part of a bigger problem with the widget design that needs to be addressed separately while taking the entire widget into the account, including when the resource is selected. For example the fact that clicking on a resource preview opens a section below it with the resource properties isn't predictable, it's just something that we all first learned experimentally. If you ask a person who never used godot what's gonna happen when they click on a resource preview you're unlikely to get \"a new section will appear below\" as a response. If anything it'd be more reasonable to expect the arrow on the right to have that effect, because it uses a down arrow icon instead of a more conventional 3-dot icon that most of the other dropdown menus are using in godot. And it also doesn't make sense that there are 2 buttons doing the exact same thing when the resource is not selected. Things like these are just confusing\r\n\r\nSo imo this part of the inspector needs a rework. But in the meantime this PR is a good temporary solution to make Quick Load function easier to reach for current users, so I think it's good","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2762715250/reactions","total_count":2,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":1,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2903447668","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/104490#issuecomment-2903447668","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/104490","id":2903447668,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6tDxh0","user":{"login":"arkology","id":43543909,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQzNTQzOTA5","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/43543909?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/arkology","html_url":"https://github.com/arkology","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arkology/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arkology/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arkology/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arkology/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arkology/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arkology/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arkology/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arkology/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arkology/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-05-23T06:52:21Z","updated_at":"2025-05-23T06:52:21Z","body":"@akien-mga could we give it a chance in the upcoming 4.5 dev?\r\nOverall feedback is OK and I don't think we'll get more until merge.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2903447668/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2904692872","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/104490#issuecomment-2904692872","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/104490","id":2904692872,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6tIhiI","user":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-05-23T14:49:57Z","updated_at":"2025-05-23T14:49:57Z","body":"Thanks!","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2904692872/reactions","total_count":3,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":3,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]